# Polymarket Gamma API — manual payload inspection
#
# No secrets required. Use to inspect event/market JSON before coding parsers.
# Not part of live calibration tooling.

@gamma_base = https://gamma-api.polymarket.com
@event_id = REPLACE_WITH_EVENT_ID

### List weather-related events (adjust limit / filters as needed)
GET {{gamma_base}}/events
    ?limit=20
    &active=true
    &closed=false

### Fetch one event by id
GET {{gamma_base}}/events/{{event_id}}

# Live order books (CLOB) — source for executable prices, not Gamma's cached fields.
@clob_base = https://clob.polymarket.com
@token_id = REPLACE_WITH_CLOB_TOKEN_ID

### Batch order books by clob token id (one request per event's buckets)
POST {{clob_base}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

[{ "token_id": "{{token_id}}" }]
